en:
The "big brother" who appeared before you
was quite clearly a monster
known as an Arob.{w}

"Please, adventurers...
please help Big Brother...
Please..."{w}

"Big Brother says eating Bona's cookies
will make him feel all better."{w}{p}"You should eat some with us too, adventurers!
They're so yummy! Bona's cookies!"{w}

"I'm sorry, adventurers.
This all happened because of Bona..."{w}{p}"You're in the middle of your journey, and you saved
not just Bona, but Big Brother too..."{w}

"Bona's going to be good from now on.
I'll listen to what Big Brother says, and become
a good monster just like him!"{w}

"Bona's not very good at it, but
I'll pray lots and lots for you, adventurers."{w}{p}"May the forest and the Sun Spirit protect you, adventurers!
Come play again, okay!"{w}

"Hi, adventurers!
Bona and Big Brother are both doing great!"{w}{p}"And so is that chatty sapling, of course."{w}{p}"Don't you worry, adventurers.
Bona's gonna take good care of it."{w}

"Hey, hey. What the heck are you buryin' me in?
Don't go buryin' some mystery junk!"{w}{p}"Even comin' from you, Bona,
gimme a break here."{w}

"This thing's sooo big, after all.
Maybe it bumped right into the sky!
But what could be up there...?"{w}

"Ohh! Adventurers, well done saving the Palace of the Sun!"{w}{p}"When I heard you adventurers were coming to this village,
I came all the way from Teridon to deliver love!"{w}{p}"Now, accept it!
This! Is the finest! LOVE!!"{w}

"You're right, Big Brother. Let's start the party!"{w}{p}"Bona could only make cookies,
but there are tons of them to make up for it!"{w}{p}"Come eat and dance with us, adventurers!
It'll be so much fun!"{w}

"Yorfa, please understand."{w}{p}"From here, I can shine down on everyone's smiling faces.
There's no greater joy than that. Isn't that right?"{w}{p}"When the sun was lost, the land was shrouded in darkness for a long while."{w}{p}"In that darkness, no one could find any light of hope, and sorrow covered the land."{w}{p}"But I rose into the sky, and made it a place overflowing with smiles and life."{w}{p}"There's no greater joy than this!
You were happy about it too, Yorfa!"{w}

"Even if this body of mine is destroyed,
I want to go on shining on the land
until the very last moment."{w}

